<title>USA: Bio Fluorescent terminates acquisition.</title>
<headline>Bio Fluorescent terminates acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio Fluorescent Technologies Inc said on Monday its Feb. 11 agreement to buy all of the assets of Immune Network Research Ltd has been terminated.</p>
<p>The company said it is exploring the licensing or acquisition of Immune's rights as licensee to an immune system disease treatment technology currently in the development stage but the company has not made an offer yet.</p>
<p>Bio Fluorescent said it would pursue acquisitions of companies with interests in diagnostic and medical devices.</p>
</text>
